Modified third-party code bundled in this repository:

  * vendor/russh-sftp-2.3.0 — russh-sftp 2.3.0 (Apache-2.0),
    Copyright russh-sftp contributors.
    Modifications by the nabiTerm authors (2026): added a filename
    charset module (src/charset.rs) and routed wire string
    encode/decode through it (src/buf.rs, src/ser.rs) to support
    SFTPv3 servers using legacy filename encodings (CP949 etc.).
    That charset state is kept per connection, so the client carries
    a charset session into the packet reader and writer
    (src/client/mod.rs, src/client/rawsession.rs).
    Changed lines are marked with "nabiTerm 벤더 패치" comments.

