Protocol interoperability:

  * crates/nabi-trzsz implements the trzsz file-transfer protocol
    (trz / tsz) so nabiTerm can interoperate with existing servers.
    The wire format was determined by reading the trzsz-go reference
    implementation (MIT, Copyright the Trzsz Authors) and by testing
    against trzsz-py. No trzsz source code was copied; the Rust
    implementation is original work by the nabiTerm authors.
